1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,167
Would you let an AI post to your books? Neither would we. So in Ledger Book, it doesn't.

2
00:00:07,167 --> 00:00:13,963
It reads your bank, and every line gets a suggested category, a confidence score and a reason.

3
00:00:13,963 --> 00:00:18,167
When it isn't sure, it asks you instead of guessing.

4
00:00:18,167 --> 00:00:22,000
Only balanced entries post. Debits equal credits, every time.

5
00:00:21,1000 --> 00:00:27,685
Posted entries can't be edited. Mistakes are reversed, and both stay on the record.

6
00:00:27,685 --> 00:00:32,630
Cash, profit and your thirteen-week runway are computed live from the journal.

7
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:40,167
The copilot can read your books and suggest. It has no tool that can post, send or move money.

8
00:00:40,167 --> 00:00:45,481
Invoice reminders are drafted for you. Nothing goes out until you send it.

9
00:00:45,481 --> 00:00:49,081
Ledger Book. AI proposes. The ledger disposes.
